{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"第 6 章 浏览器显示网页","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：第 6 章 浏览器显示网页。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"浏览器收到 HTML 文本后，把它\"画\"成你看到的网页：先解析文字，再下载图片、CSS、JS，最后排版渲染。\n\n这就是你从输入网址到看到百度首页的全过程——前后大概 0.1 秒。\n\n---","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":9,"grade_min":7,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「第 6 章 浏览器显示网页」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"第 6 章 浏览器显示网页","slug":"junior-network-topic-06","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「第 6 章 浏览器显示网页」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":12,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-006-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"545eacd59d2c9c3bf855640453fbf6d151aab390001ddcdee8b233dc01bddeaf","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/545eacd59d2c9c3b/05-网络是怎样连接的.md"},"stage":"JUNIOR","title":"第 6 章 浏览器显示网页"},"content_hash":"aff37d472210eae8a8fcd350690d606688897f96262a340cf25a37d326f3dccf","course":{"slug":"junior-network","title":"网络是怎样连接的","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
